//! Extractors: `Symbols` (definitions/references via tree-sitter queries → `Symbol` nodes + `Defines`/`References` edges), `WikiLinks` (`[[page]]`, `[[page#heading]]`, markdown links → `Links` edges), `Headings` (document outline), `Frontmatter` (YAML → properties), `Imports` (module graph). Each is a `trait Extractor { fn applies(&self, node) -> bool; fn extract(&self, node, content) -> Vec<Derived> }`.
